.DS_Store
.gitignore
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Large reference PDFs/scans (exceed GitHub 100MB limit) - keep local only.
# The small newspaper transcriptions in newspapers/Transcriptions/ ARE committed.
chicago/reference/Andreas-History_of_Chicago.pdf
chicago/reference/planning/Andreas-History_of_Chicago.pdf
chicago/reference/newspapers/**/*.pdf
chicago/reference/newspapers/*.pdf

# Large video captures - keep local only
chicago/reference/movies/

# Wau-Bun text sources: the author's .docx dump and the 500 KB public-domain
# epub. The generated per-scene passages ARE committed (site/wau-bun/js/).
wau-bun/sources/
# per-scene dumps of the (uncommitted) source text, regenerated by build-text.py
wau-bun/source-scenes/

# Stay Finder: generated single-file bundle for publishing (see stay/build-artifact.py)
site/stay/artifact.html

# Stay Finder: cached TIGERweb downloads for the map builder
stay/geo-cache/

# Chicago reference corpus: large source files migrated to Internet Archive.
# Canonical copies live at archive.org/details/chicago1835-*; originals sit
# locally at projects/archive/data/chicago/reference/ (sibling to this repo,
# not tracked). See the *.yaml / SOURCE.yaml pointer files in chicago/reference/
# and CORPUS_MANIFEST.csv for the mapping. Guards below catch big originals
# being re-downloaded into the tracked dirs by mistake.
chicago/reference/fergus/*.pdf
chicago/reference/walkthroughs/*.mov

# IPUMS extracts: redistribution prohibited by IPUMS license, local-only.
# Originals live at projects/archive/data/chicago/reference/ipums/.
# See chicago/reference/ipums/README.md.
chicago/reference/ipums/*.csv
chicago/reference/ipums/*.pdf
chicago/reference/ipums/nhgis0001_csv/
chicago/reference/ipums/nhgis0001_csv.zip
chicago/reference/ipums/nhgis0001_shape/
chicago/reference/ipums/nhgis0001_shape.zip
!chicago/reference/ipums/README.md
